/bob-cli-c5/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Retire rollup frontmatter in bob-cli[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]retire-rollup[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]retire-rollup: delete rollup parsing, selection, lints, catalog counts, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and the projects-list marker from bob-cli; rename the pre-rollup chain [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]to the residence chain; update vectors, H-vectors, and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The root_parent dimension in bob stats[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]root-dimension[dim] · [dim][/dim]after retire-rollup[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]root-dimension: derive each home's root parent in the resolver and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]report an additive root_parent parts dimension and catalog field for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Pomodoro and task metrics, with human output, tests, docs, and a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]performance check.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Day strip above the badges with a full-width root-parent bar[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]strip-above[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]strip-above: host the strip as the bob-plan block's first child, add the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]full-width bar row under a legend and meta row, prefer root_parent parts[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with an area fallback, and extend the preview harness and tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stats dash Root parents view and plugin rollup removal[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]stats-roots[dim] · [dim][/dim]after root-dimension, strip-above[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]stats-roots: replace Areas & projects with a Root parents view grouped [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]by area with sub-project disclosure, route the strip's hand-off to it, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]drop rollup from the JS home mirror, and refresh fixtures and previews.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Contract docs, heading total cleanup, glossary strands[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]closeout[dim] · [dim][/dim]after stats-roots[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]closeout: rewrite the Day strip and Stats block contract in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs/stats.md, remove the heading total per the decision, add the four [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]glossary strands, and settle memory beads bob-cli-bt and bob-cli-bs.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-c5","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-c5.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-f58dfdf75b414e4aa4c85f6e0d420148","started_at":"2026-10-25T14:30:02.318126+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"d0697584e13a9a48a199ba1a90d2e8dc77ef988f9bead784a3dcd5766b97541b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-c5.land--plan/chat.md","size_bytes":7947},"commits":{"digest":"34d4606b25412833d90d9e44fedb3665bb6153b5d86c15ca177ed94c4e42b506","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-c5.land--plan/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-c5.land--plan/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"c2e745b7560952889daf80103e6ce034cf093bfe1b268df1de0056d88d04a